     72  162b							; M or SPACE changed: muteNow = mute xor momentary. The SID goes to volume 0;
     73  162b							; the Game Boy and NES get note-offs (so nothing hangs on, and their tails
     74  162b							; ring out naturally), and their notes come back when it unmutes.
     75  162b				   MuteChanged
